Organizing directory nested inside a described archive, mirroring en/messages/. Holds this language's interface message catalogs, gettext .po files, split by bin/ and lib/ the same way: no sidecar, no work, no Dublin Core. bin/sat-bin.po carries the CLI's own strings; lib/ is empty for now, since satlib's reported messages are not yet routed through the translator. When sat's interface_language is set to fr, prompts and feedback come from these catalogs; the command names sat init and the like stay the same in every language.
